{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Permission flow test: file.save to //tmp/X is a REAL out-of-root path\n(// → OS root, bypasses RootDirectory prefix). Authorize prompts via the\nregistered \"input\" channel — ProbeAnswerer returns \"a\" → grant signed +\nstored → save proceeds. The /tmp file gets written for real.",
